                                                "sense_id": "c9e8f5ae-05ab-3cc4-9918-601870639249",
                                                "text": "Each disliked the choice of the other. \"Charles is a stern name,\" she affirmed. \"Nonsense,\" said Philip. \"It's as agreeable a name as there is. Dennis sounds like a comical Irish story.\" \"You just show your bad feeling when you say such a thing,\" she retorted. \"'T is a grand name!\""
                                            }
